sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Analyst
    participant F as Frontend
    participant B as Backend API
    participant C as Recommendation Controller
    participant P as Policy Guard
    participant R as RAG Manager
    participant V as Vector DB
    participant E as Evidence Retriever
    participant T as Prompt Template Factory
    participant L as LLM Client
    participant X as LLM Endpoint
    participant CVal as Citation Validator
    participant K as Knowledge Projector
    participant Aud as Audit Emitter

    A->>F: Enter question + project_id
    F->>B: POST /projects/{id}/recommendations
    B->>C: POST /get_recommendation
    C->>P: validate scope/role/request
    P-->>C: allowed / denied
    C->>R: retrieve(question, filters, top_k)
    R->>V: semantic search
    V-->>R: fragment candidates
    R->>E: resolve exact text/locator/hash/version
    E-->>R: evidence package
    R->>T: build versioned evidence-first prompt
    T-->>R: prompt
    R->>L: generate recommendation + claims
    L->>X: inference
    X-->>L: model output
    L-->>R: recommendation + claim candidates
    R-->>C: candidate response
    C->>CVal: validate claims vs evidence
    CVal-->>C: citations + validation verdict
    C->>K: apply role view
    K-->>C: role-projected result
    C->>Aud: emit trace/outcome
    C-->>B: result + citations + warnings + trace_id
    B-->>F: response
    F-->>A: recommendation/evidence/review status
